# Saga-tree slices (issues #57 + #115): break the SAGA_DEFINITIONS value
# cycle via a leaf registry (shared.ts no longer value-imports a module
# that transitively imports its importers; canonical order preserved) with
# a leaf-first regression test, plus the second migration pilot
# (ninjaone-org-lookup: one live NinjaOne read, form-bound query, history).
# New Saga module + tests + manifest/catalog/registration pins only. No
# catalog semantics, identity, D1, solutions/tables/forms contract, or new
# primitive changes. Worker + Workflows + D1 only.
